{"description": "<div><body><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Opportunity</strong></b><br><br><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are looking for a hands-on DevOps Lead who enjoys keeping production systems reliable while building the next generation of operational tooling. You will help move AI initiatives beyond experimentation into secure, measurable, production-ready automation and improvements across Software Operations.  </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You will join a 16-person DevOps and SRE team supporting global IoT and connected-vehicle platforms, reporting directly to the Head of DevOps and SRE. This is an individual contributor role with no direct reports, working closely with engineering, security, and operations teams around the world.  </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This role is based in Bucharest, with a hybrid work model requiring at least</span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> 2 days per week in the office</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> (The Bridge 3, Sector 6).</span><br><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Key Responsibilities</strong></b><br><br><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Balance engineering improvements and operational responsibilities, with an approximate 70/30 allocation between engineering improvements, automation, and AI initiatives versus production operations. This is a flexible guideline rather than a fixed weekly split and may shift during critical releases or major incidents. You will take ownership of prioritizing improvements and establishing sustainable boundaries for operational work in collaboration with your manager. </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">70% — Automation, Continuous Improvement & AI </strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Design, build, and maintain automation that removes repetitive operational tasks and increases the efficiency and consistency of DevOps and SRE workflows.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Develop AI-assisted tools and agent-based workflows for incident triage, troubleshooting, knowledge retrieval, operational reporting, and runbook assistance.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Connect LLM services and internal systems through APIs and orchestration tooling, with validation, access controls, auditability, and human approval for sensitive actions.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Improve CI/CD, GitOps, infrastructure as code, cloud platform tooling, security controls, and observability.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Own improvements from proof of concept through production, assessing reliability, adoption, and measurable operational impact.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Collaborate across Software Operations and Engineering to identify valuable automation opportunities and enable practical AI adoption.  </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">30% — Production Operations, Reliability & On-Call </strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Help maintain the reliability, performance, security, and availability of production cloud services.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Troubleshoot incidents, support deployments and changes, contribute to root-cause analysis, and prevent recurring issues.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Participate in a scheduled </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">on-call rotation</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, including response outside normal working hours when rostered. Overtime worked is compensated in line with company policy and applicable law.  </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Qualifications</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Senior experience in DevOps, Cloud, Platform Engineering, SRE, or infrastructure automation, including production ownership.  </span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hands-on cloud experience (preferably Google Cloud Platform), Linux, Kubernetes (ideally GKE), and infrastructure as code (e.g., Terraform).  </span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience with CI/CD, Git-based delivery, Jenkins, and GitOps principles; familiarity with FluxCD or Argo CD.  </span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong scripting and development skills, especially Python, including REST APIs and programmatic system integrations.  </span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience with monitoring, logging, and troubleshooting using tools such as Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, ELK, or cloud-native observability.  </span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Practical experience building or integrating LLM-powered tools or AI-assisted automation, shown through delivered work or meaningful personal projects.  </span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Understanding of production incident response, secure automation, reliability, and safe change management at scale.  </span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong ownership, analytical thinking, and professional proficiency in English for collaboration with global teams.  </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bonus Points </strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience with LLM APIs, agent/tool-calling, RAG, Model Context Protocol (MCP), or orchestration tools such as LibreChat and n8n.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience with GCP-native services, Cloud Build, Secret Manager, cloud networking, PostgreSQL, or Redis.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Familiarity with messaging (Kafka, MQTT, RabbitMQ), ingress, and security tooling (NGINX, Cloud Armor).  </span><br><br></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Why Aeris?</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This is a high-impact engineering role: you will design and deliver automation and AI solutions used by Software Operations teams, not just prototypes.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You will have the autonomy to propose improvements, influence technical decisions, and help shape how AI is adopted in day-to-day operations.  </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You will gain exposure to globally deployed, business-critical cloud platforms and collaborate with experienced engineers across functions and regions.  </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our Process</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">30 min Talent Team Discussion – Teams. </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">60 min Peer Technical Interview – Teams. </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">60 min Hiring Manager Interview - On-site/ Teams. </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">30 min N+1 Interview - Teams. </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><i><em style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please note that this reflects the current agreed interview process and may be adjusted or updated as the recruitment process progresses.</em></i><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><br><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The base compensation range across Romania is RON 348,720- 496,800 gross per year. </strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Certain roles may be eligible for bonus. </span><br><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Additional Benefits:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">25 + days Vacation; </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Health Insurance Private plan (EE+ Dependents); </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Life Insurance; </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lunch Allowance; </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Home Internet WFH supplement. </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><i><em style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Aeris is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, religion, national origin, marital status, age, disability, veteran status, genetic information, or any other protected status.</em></i></p></body></div>", "salary": "", "remote": true, "doar_remote": false, "nivel": "Senior (5-10 ani)", "limbi": []}